---
const title = 'Contribution received · The $100 Fire-Ring Commons';
const description = 'Stripe has returned you to PointCast after the hosted contribution checkout.';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
    <meta name="description" content={description} />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#10191f" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <title>{title} · PointCast</title>
    <style>
      :root { color-scheme: dark; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; }
      * { box-sizing: border-box; }
      body {
        min-height: 100vh;
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 24px;
        background: #10191f;
        color: #fff8e9;
      }
      main { width: min(720px, 100%); }
      p:first-child { color: #f2b446; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; }
      h1 { margin: 24px 0; font: 400 clamp(58px, 11vw, 112px)/.82 Georgia, serif; letter-spacing: -.055em; }
      p { max-width: 610px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; }
      a {
        display: inline-flex;
        margin-top: 24px;
        padding: 14px 18px;
        border: 1px solid currentColor;
        color: inherit;
        font-size: 11px;
        letter-spacing: .08em;
        text-decoration: none;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }
      a:hover, a:focus-visible { background: #ef5a32; outline: 0; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <p>PointCast Field Study 006</p>
      <h1>One module closer.</h1>
      <p>Stripe will send the payment receipt to the email used at checkout. This confirms project support only—not a ticket, reservation, charitable donation, tax deduction, event date, attendance promise, or fire-ring claim.</p>
      <p>The next honest milestone is clearance for a small field test. Until then, the contribution supports reusable equipment, safety, access, documentation, and a future compliant iteration.</p>
      <a href="/beach-commons/v6">Return to the Fire-Ring Commons ←</a>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
